            "review_title": "Review at Kim's House",
            "review_text": "Supe\nAdelaide, Australia19 contributions\n0\nKim’s House hits the Spot.\nAug 2024 • Couples\nThis place is an easy walk from the Hilton Garden Inn.\nThe staff seated us, directed a fan (it was still hot at 7 ) and supplied ice and 2 cold Huda Beers.\nThe food was good, the seafood fried rice having that lovely flavour of the breath of the wok.\nA really fresh mango salad topped with lovely prawns and squid was a treat!\nThe tasty fresh food and the great service with a bill of less than 400,000 dong hit the spot!\nSitting street side, drink in hand with decent food was just what we wanted.\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2024",
